[agent:result] ## Platform Constraints Encountered
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] The Databricks Serverless workspace does not have cluster creation capabilities. 
[agent:result] This prevents running PySpark MLlib code for model training. The workaround was to:
[agent:result] 1. Use SQL for all data transformations
